### Concept
- Techno-thriller about legal economic warfare at scale
- Organization "The Consortium" runs 6 operations: MINOTAUR (patent), SIREN (HFT), GOLEM (litigation), BASILISK (regulatory capture), HYDRA (debt), CHIMERA (real estate)
- 46,000 agents, $69.3B annual damage, all 100% legal
- Protagonist: Elena Marsh (FinCEN forensic accountant)
- Antagonist: Martin Kessler (corporate attorney/architect)
- Concept bible: technically-legal/concepts.md

